  "steps": [
    "Add 160 g silken tofu to a blender with water and blend until completely smooth and creamy.",
    "Add 35 g rice flour + 1 tbsp cornstarch to a bowl. Add zucchini, carrot, onion and cabbage.",
    "Season with salt, red chilli powder and black pepper.",
    "Add the blended tofu and mix everything thoroughly.",
    "The consistency should be thick but pourable not watery. If it’s genuinely too thick, add little water.",
    "Heat a non-stick pan and lightly grease it with 1 tsp oil.",
    "Spoon small portions onto the pan and spread them into small, relatively thin pancakes. Sprinkle black sesame seeds on top.",
    "Cook over medium-hugh heat until the underside is golden, crisp and completely set before flipping. Flip and cook the other side until crisp.",
    "Serve immediately with soy sauce dressing (soua sauce + lemon juice + water + honey + salt + 1/2 chopped green chili)."
